"**Film featuring both Simon\u202fFarnaby (the second\u2011oldest member of the Them\u202fThere collective) and Olivia\u202fColman (winner of the 91st Academy Award for Best Actress):**\n\n| Film | Year | Notes |\n|------|------|-------|\n| **Wonka** | 2023 | Olivia\u202fColman stars as the Royal Family\u2019s Royal *Baker* in the Timoth\u00e9e\u202fChalamet\u2011directed \u201cWonka\u201d film.  Simon\u202fFarnaby is credited as a co\u2011writer of the movie, bringing the two talent together on the same production. |\n\n> *Sources*  \n> \u2022\u202fOlivia\u202fColman\u2019s win at the 91st Academy Awards \u2013 \u201cOlivia\u202fColman, Best Actress winner\u201d (Wikipedia).  \n> \u2022\u202fSimon\u202fFarnaby\u2019s role in *Wonka* \u2013 \u201cWONKA (Co\u2011writer)\u201d (Independent Talent).  \n\n**Thus, the only film that brings together both the second\u2011oldest member of Them\u202fThere and the 91st\u2011year Oscar Best Actress winner is *Wonka* (2023).**"